schema: "0.4"
id: deep-focus-02-knowledge-article-viewer
type: image
quality: high

# The Robot Learns — a terminal study CLI. Knowledge Article Viewer — the read view for a
# single saved KB article, rendered in the terminal pager. This is the theme's reference
# density screen (long-form reading in a single calm column).
# Theme tenets: calm navy-black dark canvas, one desaturated teal accent, 6px soft radius,
# IBM Plex Sans prose + IBM Plex Mono for IDs, at most one saturated hue on screen.
# Palette: canvas #0a0e1a, surface #0f1629, border #1e293b, body #cbd5e1, teal accent #14b8a6.

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a senior product designer rendering a high-fidelity UI mockup of a calm,
    immersive dark TERMINAL pager — a single focused terminal window, not a web page and not a
    browser. This is the theme's quiet reading surface: a long-form article rendered in the
    terminal at a comfortable measure, deep navy stillness, one desaturated teal signal-light.
    Prose in a clean humanist sans; tags, IDs, sources and paths in a matched monospace.
    Generous line-height, content-first, nothing ornamental. No neon, no glow, no gloom.
  text: |
    A 16:9 high-fidelity mockup of a focused single-pane TERMINAL PAGER — "The Robot Learns"
    — reading one saved knowledge article. One calm dark terminal window fills the frame on a
    deep navy-black canvas. NO browser chrome, NO tabs, NO address bar, NO web page.

    OVERALL LAYOUT (a dominant reading column with a slim left rail):
    - LEFT RAIL (narrow): a quiet table-of-contents / section list for the article, current
      section marked by a 2px teal left rail and slightly brighter slate text; the rest muted.
    - CENTER (dominant reading column): the ARTICLE. A title in medium-weight sans, then a
      thin METADATA STRIP in monospace — a "verified" state, tags, and last-updated — then the
      CALIBRATED ANSWER BLOCK as the article body: several paragraphs of calm sans prose at
      generous line-height with a short capped measure, one inline monospace term, and a small
      block-quote note recessed one navy step.
    - Inside the body: a CITATION LIST — two or three numbered source lines in monospace, each
      a muted title plus a faint link, sitting on a slightly-recessed darker-navy panel.

    BELOW / ALONGSIDE THE BODY:
    - a TAG / CATEGORY row: small ghost pill chips with faint slate outlines ("algorithms",
      "spaced-repetition", "+ add tag"), one showing an inline-edit caret in teal.
    - RELATED TOPICS chips in a second muted row.
    - a faint bottom status line in monospace: "r refresh · v verify · e edit in $EDITOR ·
      j/k scroll".

    PALETTE & TYPE: deep navy-black canvas with one or two barely-lighter navy steps for the
    citation panel and block-quote; body text in bright cool slate, secondary/meta in dimmer
    slate; a single calm desaturated teal as the ONLY saturated element — the active TOC rail,
    the verified check, the edit caret. No second bright hue. Article prose in a calm humanist
    sans; metadata, citations, IDs and keys in a matched monospace.

    SHAPE & SURFACE: soft-technical small rounded corners on the citation panel and chips;
    separation by tonal navy layering, not borders — faint slate hairlines only where a region
    is genuinely divided. No gradients, no glow, flat calm layering.

    MOOD: focused, immersive, calm — a quiet study room at 2 AM, unhurried long-form reading.
  negative: "watermark, signature, lorem ipsum placeholder text, low-fidelity wireframe, monitor/device photograph framing, blurry, distorted UI, browser chrome, address bar, browser tabs, web page, light mode, neon glow, gradient background"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.72
  criteria:
    relevance: {weight: 3, description: "Matches the Knowledge Article Viewer: a reading column with title, monospace metadata strip, article body, a numbered citation list, and tag/category + related chips, with a slim section rail — inside one terminal pager"}
    theme_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Deep navy-black dark canvas, a single desaturated teal accent (no second saturated hue), soft small radius, calm sans prose + mono metadata — a nocturne reading surface, not generic UI defaults"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Content-first hierarchy, dominant capped reading measure, plausible real-product terminal layout"}
    technical: {weight: 2, description: "Sharp, correct 16:9 aspect, no artifacts"}
  reject_if:
    - "lorem ipsum or placeholder text visible"
    - "watermark or signature visible"
    - "wireframe-level fidelity instead of high-fidelity mockup"
    - "browser chrome, tabs, or address bar instead of a terminal window"
    - "more than one saturated accent hue on screen"

tags: [deep-focus, therobotlearns.com, screen-mockup, terminal]
